From bf7c9e8dd5e124fd0c99b6bfa0b9efd35c5cb9d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: allcodernet <67543055+allcodernet@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:39:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/45] decide: aggregation of node logits into option
 distributions

Add decide-score.{h,cpp}: score_field aggregates per-branch-node
log-softmax over children into per-option log-probabilities (summed
along each option's trie path), normalises with softmax, and throws
error{"engine", 500} when every option scores -inf. answer_json
renders the CHOICE/SCORE/BOOL answer shapes from a field_answer.
